ntic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":286688,"global_rank":30113,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6439},{"name":"gisenberg/local-model-eval","owner":"gisenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/gisenberg/local-model-eval","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":286677,"global_rank":30123,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6440},{"name":"lesleslie/bodai","owner":"lesleslie","html_url":"https://github.com/lesleslie/bodai","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Meta-project for the Bodai ecosystem \u2014 configuration, documentation, and operations across all components","topics":[],"score":286666,"global_rank":30125,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6441},{"name":"AllenInstitute/aibs-informatics-test-resources","owner":"AllenInstitute","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenInstitute/aibs-informatics-test-resources","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python test utility package ","topics":["aibs-informatics","open-source"],"score":286665,"global_rank":38858,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6442},{"name":"mapl